<div class="pp-html" style="padding:64px 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f5e9ec)">
  <div class="page-width">
<div class="pp-love">
  <p class="pp-love__eyebrow">The short version</p>
  <h2 class="pp-love__title">Everything a liner should do.<br><em>Most don't.</em></h2>
  <p class="pp-love__sub">Six reasons this one earns a permanent spot in your bag.</p>
  <ul class="pp-love__grid" role="list">
    <li class="pp-love__item">
      <span class="pp-love__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19c4-1 6-4 8-8s3-6 5-7c1.6-.9 2.8.6 2 2-1 1.8-4 3-8 4.2S5 13 4 19Z"/><path d="M4 19c2.5-.6 4.5-1.6 6-3"/></svg></span>
      <h3>One Stroke</h3><p>Full payoff in a single pass. No building, no patching over a thin line.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="pp-love__item">
      <span class="pp-love__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="8"/><path d="M12 9v4l2.5 2.5M9 2h6"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Sets in Seconds</h3><p>Draw it, blink, done. It stops moving before you have found your mascara.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="pp-love__item">
      <span class="pp-love__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3s6 6.4 6 10.2A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.2C6 9.4 12 3 12 3Z"/><path d="M9 14a3 3 0 0 0 3 3"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Water &amp; Tear Proof</h3><p>Gym, heatwave, ugly cry at a wedding. The line does not care.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="pp-love__item">
      <span class="pp-love__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 13s4-6 10-6 10 6 10 6-4 6-10 6-10-6-10-6Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="2.6"/><path d="M6 5.5C8 4 10 3.4 12 3.4s4 .6 6 2.1"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Liner &amp; Brow</h3><p>The same fine tip does both jobs. One pencil out, not three.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="pp-love__item">
      <span class="pp-love__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="10" r="4.2"/><circle cx="15" cy="10" r="4.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="16" r="4.2"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Seven Shades</h3><p>Blackest Black to barely-there Stone, plus a Plum that wakes up green eyes.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="pp-love__item">
      <span class="pp-love__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4c-8 0-13 4-14 10l-2 6"/><path d="M20 4c0 8-4 12-10 13l-4 1"/><path d="M15 6c-4 1-7 4-8 8"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Kind to Lids</h3><p>Glides instead of dragging, so you are not tugging at thin skin every morning.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

